{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Sampler","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Keeps a fraction of the events it applies to, and drops the rest before they are held, written"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or delivered: event by event, or a whole group of events, such as a session, at once."}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Trackers\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"kind":"relationships"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"anchor":"Sampling","title":"Sampling","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRate","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/SampleRateKey","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/InvalidSampleRate"],"generated":true}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Sampler"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker built with samplers runs them on its worker, after its enrichers, so a sampler sees"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"what they set:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let tracker = Tracker(samplers: [","    .events(of: Scrolled.self, rate: try SampleRate(0.1)),","    .events(where: { $0.consentCategory == .performance }, rate: try SampleRate(0.5)),","])"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each sampler decides on its own, and a record is kept only if every sampler that applies to it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keeps it. A kept record carries the product of their rates as its "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentati